    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "surrender? what do you mean by that... it just feels like nothing i do matters anymore. no matter how much i try to fix things or keep going, it's just the same cycle of misery every single day. it feels like there's no light at the end of the tunnel, just more of this.",
